<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Sousse Guide: 11 places – medina, Ribat, El Jem, Kairouan &amp; more – HiddenGem.Atlas</name><description>https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/sousse/</description><Style id="must"><IconStyle><color>ff4cd8ff</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Style id="gem"><IconStyle><color>ffd0569b</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Placemark><name>1. Medina and Ribat</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Come early in the morning and climb the Ribat tower first. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/sousse/#o1</description><Point><coordinates>10.63858,35.82765,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>4. Archaeological Museum in the Kasbah</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Perfect for the hot midday hours. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/sousse/#o4</description><Point><coordinates>10.63542,35.82316,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>5. Souks &amp; lanes of the medina</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Compare prices in several shops before you buy. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/sousse/#o5</description><Point><coordinates>10.63906,35.8258,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>8. Monastir – Ribat &amp; mausoleum</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Take the Metro du Sahel and walk to the sea. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/sousse/#o8</description><Point><coordinates>10.83291,35.77616,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>10. Port El Kantaoui – harbour &amp; promenade</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · Come in the evening an